  chapterName: Kapre
  chapterDescription: A dark, hairy giant living in old trees, wearing a loincloth
    and smoking a giant pipe. He enjoys tricking night travelers into getting lost,
    leaving behind a sudden smell of sweet cigar smoke and rustling leaves.
  chapterUnlocked: 1
  storyUnlocked: 0
  killsNeededToUnlockName: 0
  killsNeededToUnlockImage: 0
  killsNeededToUnlockDesc: 0
  shortStory: "The sweet, earthy smell of tobacco hit Marco just as he realized he\u2019d
    walked in three circles around the ancient acacia tree.\r\n\r\nHe looked up into
    the dark canopy. High above, two amber eyes glowed beside the burning ember of
    an impossibly large pipe. Sitting comfortably on a massive branch, the giant,
    hairy figure took a slow drag, exhaling a cloud of smoke that blanketed the trail.\r\n\r\nRemembering
    his grandmother's advice, Marco didn't run. He calmly slipped off his shirt,
    flipped it inside out, and put it back on.\r\n\r\nThe Kapre let out a low, rumbling
    laugh that shook the leaves, charmed by the boy\u2019s respect for the old trick.
    With a flick of the giant's wrist, the tangled brush cleared, revealing the direct
    path back to the village.\r\n\r\nMarco gave a quiet nod of thanks and headed
    home, guided through the dark by the faint smell of sweet leaf smoke.\r"
